ness (could be G-M related, after all - this works best with Inquisitors); Laying low in the country after a bad incident (works best with Saboteurs); Tracking down a Soul Pact (works best with Tempters);<br /> Werewolf: Prey*'s trail leads to the village; Vision/Dream (if Cahalith) leads there; Relative of Pack member calls for help from there;<br /> <br /> BONUS ROUND:<br /> Vampire: ...Depends greatly on the vampire - they don't usually like to travel.<br /> Mage: News of a Mystery thereabouts<br /> Changeling: A bad Hedge trip ends up with them finding their way out near the location.<br /> Geist: Ghostly business draws them to the area; Bad Underworld detour; They trace (a) strange procession(s) of lantern carrying ghosts back to their source.<br /> Mummy: They are following a relic that has fallen into the cult's hands and/or are tracking a former cultist that has jumped ship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-25T16:27:12-08:00","id":1038101,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the suggestions. Also, what do you think of them scarecrow masks as disguises and farming tools as weapons","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Post